  "seoBody": "<h2>£75 a month for each phone number that works</h2><p>A phone number counts if it did at least one check that month. Everyone else is free. The minimum is £75 a month. Billed monthly by UK Direct Debit.</p><h2>Free plan</h2><p>10 Records a month, with up to 10 photos each. No card. No trial clock. You add a Direct Debit only when you need more.</p><p>Paid accounts have no limits: reports, photos and messages are unlimited.</p><h2>Why not per seat?</h2><p>Most tools charge for every name on the account, used or not. Quickler charges only for phones that did a check. Read <a href=\"/pages/no-subscription-compliance.html\">why we charge this way</a>.</p><h2>Bigger teams</h2><p>Big team? <a href=\"mailto:hello@quickler.co\">Talk to us</a>. Quickler works in any country WhatsApp does. See <a href=\"/pages/global-field-compliance.html\">Quickler worldwide</a>.</p><h2>Pricing questions</h2><h3>How much does Quickler cost?</h3><p>£75 a month for each phone number that did at least one check that month. The minimum is £75 a month. Everyone else is free.</p><h3>Which phone numbers do I pay for?</h3><p>Only phones that did at least one check that month. A phone that did none costs nothing. People who only read the reports are free.</p><h3>Is there a free plan?</h3><p>Yes. You get 10 Records a month, with up to 10 photos each. No card. No trial clock.</p><h3>Do I pay per seat?</h3><p>No. Most tools charge for every name on the account. Quickler only charges for phone numbers that did a check that month.</p><h3>How is Quickler billed?</h3><p>Monthly by UK Direct Debit. You add one only when you move off the free plan.</p>",
